<title>SOUTH KOREA: Anam Industrial 1996 net shrinks.</title>
<headline>Anam Industrial 1996 net shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     1,182 vs 1,853</p>
<p>    Net					     19.72 vs  23.44</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>     common shares		 stock	  one vs 3</p>
<p>					  cash	    7 vs 6</p>
<p>     preferred shares	    stock	 none vs 3</p>
<p>					  cash	    8 vs 7</p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,125.88 vs 970.22</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   27.01 vs  30.87</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both loss)		3.32 vs   2.80</p>
<p>    Div Register					Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Payment				     late March</p>
<p>NOTE - Anam Industrial Co Ltd's share capital increased to 23.37 million shares at the end of 1996 from 17.55 million at end-1995 due to dividend payments in stock and right issues.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
